<title>INDIA: India's Mukand 1996/97 net down.</title>
<headline>India's Mukand 1996/97 net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   131.94  vs    409.43</p>
<p>    Net sales	  8,684.89  vs 10,925.14</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	2.5   vs	3.5</p>
<p>    Profit after tax   140.77  vs    437.15</p>
<p>    Other income     1,79.41   vs     79.49</p>
<p>    Expenditure	7,822.33  vs  9,745.41</p>
<p>    Interest	     678.33  vs    542.69</p>
<p>    Gross profit	 363.65  vs    716.53</p>
<p>    Depreciation	 179.24  vs    171.42</p>
<p>    Extraordinary	 25.64  vs	5.46</p>
<p>items</p>
<p>    Tax		     18.0   vs    102.50</p>
<p>    Prior period	   8.83  vs     27.72</p>
<p>adjustments</p>
<p>Note: India's Mukand Steel Ltd is a manufacturer of steel products. The firm said its reserves, excluding revaluation reserves, stood at 3.47 billion rupees against 3.29 billion the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
